Z||000016||SLYGUY||12-01-2001||06:59 PM||||I found my 88GT 5 spd after a short search of Autotrader. It had 100,725 miles on it. I paid $5100 after tax at a dealer. I've had to replace the alternator (2nd day) clutch master cylinder, replaced the driver's side headlight bushings. I've put another five hundered into having the brakes checked out (turned out fine) and having the stereo replaced, alarm installed.<P>Oh, also a few bucks on a complete tuneup and fluid/filter change but that is a given regardless.<P>Good luck<P>Sly<P>P.S. I know I paid too much but I wanted it that bad so :sad:<P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ViewImage.jpg"> ||||reg||1
